<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V WEST INDIES SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA V WEST INDIES SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE, Australia 1997-01-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in the</p>
<p>limited overs World Series match between Australia and West</p>
<p>Indies at the Gabba on Sunday:</p>
<p>Australia</p>
<p> M.Taylor c Murray b McLean		26</p>
<p> M.Waugh run out			    102</p>
<p> S.Law c Lara b Bishop		     93</p>
<p> S.Waugh run out				6</p>
<p> M.Bevan not out			     18</p>
<p> G.Blewett not out			   18</p>
<p> Extras (lb-7 w-3 nb-8)		    18</p>
<p> Total (for four wickets, 50 overs)   281</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-57, 2-202, 3-227, 4-253.</p>
<p>Did not bat: T.Moody, I.Healy, S.Warne, A.Bichel, A.Stuart.</p>
<p>Bowling: Walsh 8-0-50-0 (nb-2), Bishop 10-2-33-1 (w-1),</p>
<p>Ambrose 9-0-53-0 (nb-5), Hooper 7-0-52-0, McLean 6-0-23-1 (nb-1</p>
<p>w-2), Chanderpaul 2-0-16-0, Adams 8-0-47-0.</p>
<p>West Indies</p>
<p> S.Campbell c Healy b Bichel		  6</p>
<p> J.Murray c Moody b Stuart		   21</p>
<p> B.Lara c Bevan b Stuart		    102</p>
