<p>Did not bat: S.Chanderpaul, R.Samuels, N.McLean, I.Bishop,</p>
<p>C.Ambrose, C.Walsh.</p>
<p>Bowling: Bichel 10-1-57-1 (w-1), Stuart 10-0-48-2, Moody</p>
<p>6.5-0-50-0, Warne 9-0-51-0 (w-1), Bevan 10-0-46-0 (w-1), S.Waugh</p>
<p>3-0-24-0.</p>
<p>Result: West Indies won by seven wickets.</p>
